    "details": {
      "method": "Before asserting cancellation or stale-result rejection, verify that the real asynchronous operation started; include the observed helper request or worker-start evidence in test success conditions. 使用已发布后不可变、单独存放的证据文件；整合回读另存。",
      "when": "An editor fixture mutates state before starting an async operation and later checks only an empty field or unchanged result.",
